    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιμετρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measure out in turn, give</i> one thing <i>as
				compensation for</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιμετρηθήσεται
			ὑμῖν</span> it <i>shall be measured in turn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				6.38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>correspond in ascension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cat.Cod.Astr.
				8(4).187
			</span></i>.</div>
